# Where this scope lives. Nothing else belongs in a committed .npmrc.
#
# The token is deliberately absent: it goes in the user-level ~/.npmrc, or in CI as
# NODE_AUTH_TOKEN, which actions/setup-node writes to a runner-temp config. A committed
# `_authToken` is a published credential, and publish-ai-toolkit.yml greps for one on every push
# rather than trusting this comment.
@przemyslawprzeworski:registry=https://npm.pkg.github.com
